;; What THIS repository reaches into the shared security package for.
;;
;; Narrowed on 2026-08-21 when the decision plane moved to kotoba-lang/grant
;; (root ADR-2608219500). `aiueos.policy` and `aiueos.audit` were the entries
;; that used abac, crypto-policy, hardware, information-flow, transport and
;; redaction, and both left. What remains here is one entrypoint using one
;; control.
;;
;; The six controls did not stop being exercised -- they are exercised in
;; grant now. Grant has no adoption record of its own yet, because the checker
;; that reads this one (`aiueos.tcb`) stayed with the machine. That gap is
;; named in root ADR-2608219500 rather than papered over by leaving stale
;; entrypoints here: a record that lists namespaces this repository no longer
;; contains would pass nothing and claim everything.
{:adoption/version 2 :consumer/id :aiueos
 :security/git-sha "49fc4ce359752e9fe6e547e9071b5b9b40da937a"
 :required-control-namespaces [kotoba.security.supply-chain]
 :security-sensitive-entrypoints
 {aiueos.reproducibility [kotoba.security.supply-chain]}
 :exceptions []}
